{
    "id":  10647,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Fixed Circular Ring for GU10-MR16 - Cut-out Ø75mm - BLACK",
    "reference":  "91822",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eTransform your spaces with our \u003cstrong\u003eblack Fixed Circular Ring\u003c/strong\u003e, a sleek and unique design that adds a contemporary touch to your lighting. Compatible with \u003cstrong\u003eGU10 or MR16\u003c/strong\u003e LED bulbs, it is ideal for both new installations and upgrading your existing bulbs. Made to fit any type of environment or décor, this fixed circular ring is the perfect choice to enhance the aesthetics of your spaces with style and functionality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRenew your lighting with this quality fixture.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#fc0202;\"\u003eCOMPATIBLE ONLY WITH LED BULBS, OTHER TYPES OF TECHNOLOGY MAY CAUSE DAMAGE TO THE INSTALLATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eFixed Circular Ring for GU10-MR16 - Cut-out Ø75mm - BLACK\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlack recessed ring\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003eLED dichroic\u003c/strong\u003e lamps, both \u003cstrong\u003eMR16\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eGU10\u003c/strong\u003e, designed to achieve an attractive and refined decoration. Thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003ecircular\u003c/strong\u003e shape you can create very exclusive environments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is made of aluminum with a black finish, which makes this ring a very resistant and long-lasting product: a \u003cstrong\u003erust-proof ring\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstallation requires a \u003cstrong\u003eØ75mm ceiling cut-out\u003c/strong\u003e. The ring measures Ø85mm x H40mm and is held firmly in place by its clips. If your opening is different, this same ring is also available with a Ø64mm cut-out (ref. 91818).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications of the Fixed Circular Ring for GU10-MR16 - Cut-out Ø75mm - BLACK\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKitchen\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBathroom\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePorches\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHypermarkets\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is ideal for any event area where select atmospheres need to be recreated. It can also withstand outdoor spaces thanks to its material.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
